{"title": "Two students dead in Philippines school shooting", "summary": "A 7th-grade student opened fire at a school in Zamboanga City, Philippines, killing a classmate and then himself. Mayor Khymer Adan Olaso stated that the gunman first fired at a teacher, though it is unclear if the teacher was hit. The incident marks the second school shooting in the Philippines within two months.", "summary_points": ["A 7th-grade student fatally shot a classmate and then died by suicide at a school in Zamboanga City, Philippines.", "Mayor Khymer Adan Olaso reported the gunman initially fired at a teacher, with the teacher's condition unknown.", "Both victims were students, including the gunman.", "This is the second school shooting in the Philippines in two months."], "title_hi": "फिलीपींस में स्कूल गोलीबारी में दो छात्रों की मौत", "summary_hi": "फिलीपींस के ज़ाम्बोआंगा शहर के एक स्कूल में सातवीं कक्षा के एक छात्र ने गोलीबारी की, जिसमें एक सहपाठी की मौत हो गई और फिर उसने खुद को भी मार लिया। मेयर खाइमर अदन ओलासो ने बताया कि बंदूकधारी ने पहले एक शिक्षक पर गोली चलाई थी, हालांकि यह स्पष्ट नहीं है कि शिक्षक को गोली लगी थी या नहीं। यह घटना दो महीने के भीतर फिलीपींस में दूसरी स्कूल गोलीबारी है।", "summary_points_hi": ["फिलीपींस के ज़ाम्बोआंगा शहर के एक स्कूल में सातवीं कक्षा के छात्र ने एक सहपाठी को गोली मार दी और फिर खुद को भी मार लिया।", "मेयर खाइमर अदन ओलासो ने बताया कि बंदूकधारी ने पहले एक शिक्षक पर गोली चलाई थी, शिक्षक की स्थिति अज्ञात है।", "दोनों पीड़ित छात्र थे, जिनमें बंदूकधारी भी शामिल था।", "यह दो महीने के भीतर फिलीपींस में दूसरी स्कूल गोलीबारी है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized that the gunman first fired at a teacher, though it was unclear if the teacher was hit.", "Highlighted that this is the second school shooting in the Philippines in two months."], "center": ["Stated that two students were killed in the high school shooting.", "Mentioned the incident involved a 7th-grade student opening fire."], "right": ["Reported that two students died in the school shooting in southern Philippines."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["इस बात पर जोर दिया कि बंदूकधारी ने पहले एक शिक्षक पर गोली चलाई थी, हालांकि यह स्पष्ट नहीं था कि शिक्षक को गोली लगी थी या नहीं।", "इस बात को उजागर किया कि यह दो महीने के भीतर फिलीपींस में दूसरी स्कूल गोलीबारी है।"], "center": ["बताया कि हाई स्कूल गोलीबारी में दो छात्रों की मौत हुई।", "उल्लेख किया कि इस घटना में सातवीं कक्षा के एक छात्र ने गोलीबारी की।"], "right": ["दक्षिणी फिलीपींस में स्कूल गोलीबारी में दो छात्रों की मौत की सूचना दी।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/eiz6ep/article71358840.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/AP08_18_2026_000002A.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/philippines-university-high-school-zamboanga-city-shooting-death-august-18-2026/article71358837.ece", "headline": "Student shot classmate to death then killed himself at school in Philippines, mayor says"}, {"source": "Amar Ujala", "owner": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/world/philippines-panic-ensues-following-school-shooting-7th-grade-student-opens-fire-2026-08-18", "headline": "Philippines: स्कूल में गोलीबारी से मचा हड़कंप; सातवीं कक्षा में पढ़ने वाले छात्र ने चलाईं गोलियां, दो घायल"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Two killed in school shooting in southern Philippines"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/18/two-killed-as-gunman-opens-fire-at-philippines-high-school-official-says?traffic_source=rss", "headline": "Two killed as gunman opens fire at Philippines high school, official says"}, {"source": "The Economic Times", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en